# =============================================================================
# PROJECT AETHER - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (.env)
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials.
# .env is ignored by Git (.gitignore) and will NEVER be committed or exfiltrated.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. PERSONAL GMAIL (IMAP over SSL, Port 993)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How to get an App Password for Gmail:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security (https://myaccount.google.com/security)
# 2. Make sure '2-Step Verification' is turned ON.
# 3. Search for 'App passwords' or go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Create an App named 'Aether' and copy the 16-character password below:
GMAIL_USER=your_personal_email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
GMAIL_IMAP_SERVER=imap.gmail.com
GMAIL_IMAP_PORT=993

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SCHOOL OUTLOOK / OFFICE 365 (IMAP over SSL, Port 993)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For University/School Microsoft 365 / Outlook accounts:
# Server: outlook.office365.com (default)
# Username: your school email (e.g. s1234567@student.edu or user@university.edu)
# Password: your school password (or App Password if MFA is enforced by your school)
OUTLOOK_USER=your_school_email@university.edu
OUTLOOK_PASSWORD=your_school_password
OUTLOOK_IMAP_SERVER=outlook.office365.com
OUTLOOK_IMAP_PORT=993

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. GOOGLE CALENDAR (100% Free Live 2-Way Sync or Secret iCal Feed)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A (Full 2-Way Sync via OAuth2):
# 1. Download credentials.json from Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services -> Credentials)
# 2. Run: python -m src.tools.login_google_calendar
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_CREDENTIALS_PATH=credentials.json
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_TOKEN_PATH=data/calendar_token.json

# Option B (Instant Zero-Setup Live Read via Secret iCal Address):
# In calendar.google.com -> Settings -> Integrate calendar -> Secret address in iCal format:
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ICAL_URL=https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/your_id/private-token/basic.ics

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OPTIONAL LOCAL OVERRIDES
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AETHER_DATA_DIR=./data
# AETHER_VAULT_DIR=./data/vault
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
